@startuml
title C4-уровень Code — Order Service (микросервис, Go)

' === ДОМЕН (Domain) ===
class Order {
  - ID: uuid.UUID
  - CustomerID: uuid.UUID
  - Status: OrderStatus
  - Items: []OrderItem
  - TotalAmount: float64
  - ShippingAddress: string
  - CreatedAt: time.Time
  - UpdatedAt: time.Time
  + Apply(event Event): void
  + GetEvent(): Event
  + Replay(events []Event): void
}

enum OrderStatus {
  NEW
  PAID
  SHIPPED
  DELIVERED
  CANCELLED
}

class OrderItem {
  - ProductID: uuid.UUID
  - ProductName: string
  - Quantity: int
  - Price: float64
  - Total: float64
}

' === ИНТЕРФЕЙСЫ (Ports) ===
interface OrderRepository {
  + Save(ctx context.Context, order *Order): error
  + FindByID(ctx context.Context, id uuid.UUID): (*Order, error)
  + FindAll(ctx context.Context, filter Filter): ([]*Order, error)
}

interface EventStore {
  + Save(aggregateID string, events ...Event): error
  + Load(aggregateID string): ([]Event, error)
}

interface EventPublisher {
  + Publish(ctx context.Context, event Event): error
}

interface SagaOrchestrator {
  + StartSaga(ctx context.Context, sagaType string, data map[string]interface{}) error
  + GetSagaStatus(ctx context.Context, sagaID string) (*SagaState, error)
}

interface ExternalServiceClient {
  + ProcessPayment(ctx context.Context, req PaymentRequest) (*PaymentResponse, error)
  + ReserveStock(ctx context.Context, req ReserveRequest) (*ReserveResponse, error)
  + SendNotification(ctx context.Context, req NotificationRequest) error
}

' === USE CASES (Application Layer) ===
class CreateOrderUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  - eventStore: EventStore
  - eventBus: EventPublisher
  - sagaOrchestrator: SagaOrchestrator
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, cmd CreateOrderCommand): (*Order, error)
}

class CancelOrderUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  - eventStore: EventStore
  - eventBus: EventPublisher
  - sagaOrchestrator: SagaOrchestrator
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, cmd CancelOrderCommand): error
}

class GetOrderUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, query GetOrderQuery): (*Order, error)
}

class ListOrdersUseCase {
  - repo: OrderRepository
  + Execute(ctx context.Context, query ListOrdersQuery): ([]*Order, error)
}

' === АДАПТЕРЫ (Adapters) ===
class PostgresOrderRepository {
  - db: *sql.DB
  + Save(ctx context.Context, order *Order): error
  + FindByID(ctx context.Context, id uuid.UUID): (*Order, error)
  + FindAll(ctx context.Context, filter Filter): ([]*Order, error)
}

class PostgresEventStore {
  - db: *sql.DB
  + Save(aggregateID string, events ...Event): error
  + Load(aggregateID string): ([]Event, error)
}

class KafkaEventPublisher {
  - producer: sarama.SyncProducer
  + Publish(ctx context.Context, event Event): error
}

class SagaOrchestratorImpl {
  - db: *sql.DB
  - clients: map[string]ExternalServiceClient
  + StartSaga(ctx context.Context, sagaType string, data map[string]interface{}) error
  + GetSagaStatus(ctx context.Context, sagaID string) (*SagaState, error)
}

class PaymentServiceClient {
  - grpcClient: paymentv1.PaymentServiceClient
  + ProcessPayment(ctx context.Context, req PaymentRequest) (*PaymentResponse, error)
}

class InventoryServiceClient {
  - grpcClient: inventoryv1.InventoryServiceClient
  + ReserveStock(ctx context.Context, req ReserveRequest) (*ReserveResponse, error)
}

class NotificationServiceClient {
  - grpcClient: notificationv1.NotificationServiceClient
  + SendNotification(ctx context.Context, req NotificationRequest) error
}

' === ЗАВИСИМОСТИ ===
Order "1" *-- "0..*" OrderItem : contains

OrderRepository <|.. PostgresOrderRepository : implements
EventStore <|.. PostgresEventStore : implements
EventPublisher <|.. KafkaEventPublisher : implements
SagaOrchestrator <|.. SagaOrchestratorImpl : implements
ExternalServiceClient <|.. PaymentServiceClient : implements
ExternalServiceClient <|.. InventoryServiceClient : implements
ExternalServiceClient <|.. NotificationServiceClient : implements

CreateOrderUseCase --> OrderRepository : uses
CreateOrderUseCase --> EventStore : uses
CreateOrderUseCase --> EventPublisher : uses
CreateOrderUseCase --> SagaOrchestrator : uses

CancelOrderUseCase --> OrderRepository : uses
CancelOrderUseCase --> EventStore : uses
CancelOrderUseCase --> EventPublisher : uses
CancelOrderUseCase --> SagaOrchestrator : uses

GetOrderUseCase --> OrderRepository : uses
ListOrdersUseCase --> OrderRepository : uses

SagaOrchestratorImpl --> ExternalServiceClient : uses

' === ПОЯСНЕНИЯ ===
note bottom of Order
  Агрегат Order:
  - Восстанавливается из событий (Event Sourcing)
  - Метод Apply(event) изменяет состояние
  - Метод GetEvent() возвращает новое событие
  - Метод Replay(events) восстанавливает всю историю
end note

note bottom of CreateOrderUseCase
  Use Case: создание заказа
  1. Создаёт агрегат Order
  2. Получает событие OrderCreated
  3. Сохраняет событие в Event Store
  4. Публикует событие в Kafka
  5. Запускает Saga (платёж → резервирование → уведомление)
end note

note bottom of SagaOrchestratorImpl
  Saga Orchestrator:
  - Координирует распределённые транзакции
  - Сохраняет состояние Saga в PostgreSQL
  - При ошибке запускает компенсацию (обратный порядок)
  - Асинхронная обработка (eventual consistency)
end note

note bottom of KafkaEventPublisher
  Kafka топики:
  - orders (OrderCreated, OrderPaid, OrderShipped, OrderCancelled)
  - payments (PaymentCompleted, PaymentFailed)
  - inventory (InventoryReserved, InventoryReleased)
  - notifications (OrderConfirmation, OrderCancellation)
end note

@enduml